00:33:53.573 --> 00:33:54.741
Sekarang kita bisa pergi.

00:33:56.993 --> 00:33:58.620
Oh, kami pasti mengundangmu

00:33:58.703 --> 00:34:00.622
ke pesta pemangkasan pohon
tahun depan, gadis.

00:34:06.670 --> 00:34:07.837
[terengah-engah]

00:34:13.385 --> 00:34:15.011
[Oscar] Anak kecil akan sangat senang.

00:34:15.679 --> 00:34:16.805
