00:34:17.430 --> 00:34:18.974
Kamu memang ada!

00:34:19.808 --> 00:34:21.726
-[dengan suara dalam] Ho-ho...
-Serius?

00:34:21.810 --> 00:34:23.144
[menghela nafas]

00:34:23.228 --> 00:34:24.437
[dengan suara dalam] Ho?

00:34:24.521 --> 00:34:26.398
-[CeCe] Santa!
-[BeBe] Santa!

00:34:26.481 --> 00:34:28.066
[keduanya tertawa, tertawa geli]

00:34:28.149 --> 00:34:29.734
