00:34:29.818 --> 00:34:32.320
[keduanya] Kami mencintaimu, Santa!

00:34:32.404 --> 00:34:34.781
-[terengah-engah] Oh!
-[♪ musik yang menyenangkan diputar]

00:34:35.282 --> 00:34:36.449
Aw.

00:34:36.533 --> 00:34:39.035
Aku juga mencintaimu, BeBe dan CeCe.

00:34:39.995 --> 00:34:42.914
Maksudku, anak-anak,
Aku memang tidak tahu.

00:34:43.456 --> 00:34:44.833
[tertawa]

00:34:48.962 --> 00:34:49.963
Ah.

00:34:57.846 --> 00:34:58.847
Huh?

00:35:00.515 --> 00:35:01.516
Uh-oh.

00:35:01.600 --> 00:35:02.726
Psst!

00:35:02.809 --> 00:35:04.477
Trainee, bangkitlah!

00:35:06.187 --> 00:35:07.188
[menghembus]

00:35:07.939 --> 00:35:09.441
Whoa! [tertawa geli]

00:35:09.524 --> 00:35:11.318
[grunting]

00:35:11.401 --> 00:35:12.819
Cepat! [thuds]

00:35:12.902 --> 00:35:14.946
Cepat, ayo. [groans]

00:35:15.030 --> 00:35:17.407
Ayo. [groans heavily]

00:35:20.327 --> 00:35:22.412
-[♪ musik hip-hop diputar]
-Bam!

00:35:22.495 --> 00:35:24.331
[percakapan tumpang tindih]

00:35:24.414 --> 00:35:25.415
